      "reference": "n = int(input())\nfor i in range(n):\n    st = input().strip()\n    max_bit = '0'\n    for ch in st:\n        if ch > max_bit:\n            max_bit = ch\n    answer = [\n        max_bit <= '1',\n        max_bit <= '7',\n        max_bit <= '9',\n        max_bit <= 'F',\n    ]\n    print(' '.join(map(str,map(int, answer))))"
